    "title": "Fatal Motorcycle Crash on Hazelgreen Road NE Marks Ninth Traffic Death in Salem This Year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago A man died Saturday night after his three-wheeled motorcycle struck an excavator on Hazelgreen Road NE near 49th Avenue NE in Salem, Oregon. The crash happened around 8:38 p.m. in a construction area that was not active at the time.\nPolice said the rider went past a closed barricade before the collision. The Traffic Team is investigating the cause. This is the ninth traffic fatality in Salem in 2025. The victim’s family has been notified.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
